anguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-it-takes-to-become-full-stack-developer\/#faq-question-1786344983389","position":6,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-it-takes-to-become-full-stack-developer\/#faq-question-1786344983389","name":"6. How long does it take to\u00a0learn\u00a0the MERN stack?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Most learners take around 4 to 8 months to become comfortable with MongoDB, Express, React, and Node.js. Focusing on one stack instead of many speeds this up significantly.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-it-takes-to-become-full-stack-developer\/#faq-question-1786344999598","position":7,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-it-takes-to-become-full-stack-developer\/#faq-question-1786344999598","name":"7. How many hours should I practice daily to become a full stack developer faster?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Practicing 2 to 4 hours daily is ideal for steady progress. Dedicating more consistent hours can shorten your timeline and improve coding confidence quickly.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-it-takes-to-become-full-stack-developer\/#faq-question-1786345014450","position":8,"url":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-it-takes-to-become-full-stack-developer\/#faq-question-1786345014450","name":"8. Does prior coding knowledge reduce the learning time?","answerCount":1,"acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, prior coding knowledge significantly reduces learning time. You already understand logic and syntax, so you can focus directly on advanced full stack concepts.","inLanguage":"en-US"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"Question","@id":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-long-it-takes-to-become-full-stack-developer\/#fa